<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoValueAssign</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to set one value to another</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Value.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoValueAssign(
    SilikoValue *object,
    const SilikoValue *sright_side);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoValueAssign</function> function assigns the
value of <varname>right_side</varname> to the object that
<varname>object</varname> points to.</para>
</refsection>
